7,55,116,26]],"links":[["Gilliam County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/oregon/gilliam-county"],["ARC or PLC in Gilliam County","/arc-plc/oregon/gilliam-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Gilliam County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids July to August came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 32% of normal in June to July and 39% in May to June. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 40% of normal on the middle of the grids. On grid 30338 the driest year was 1967, at 56% of normal.</p>"}
